WEBVTT

01:03.313 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:19.329 --> 01:21.539
You spent the night out? Where did you go?

01:21.623 --> 01:24.292
I clearly told you
that I'd just change my clothes, and…

01:31.216 --> 01:33.593
What's wrong? What happened?

01:37.555 --> 01:39.474
A Mongolian boy paid me a visit.

01:42.769 --> 01:44.187
He gave me back my memories.

01:46.815 --> 01:47.941
I caused you…

01:52.654 --> 01:53.988
My arrogance made you…

01:55.490 --> 01:56.825
I found out about everything.

02:04.791 --> 02:07.919
That doesn't matter anymore.
That's just the past.

02:08.670 --> 02:09.838
We're here now.

02:09.921 --> 02:12.757
You said you can't resurrect the dead
or take us to the future.

02:13.633 --> 02:15.635
But actually, it was the future just now.

02:15.718 --> 02:19.013
Just now and just now. And just now again.

02:21.307 --> 02:22.642
Let's go together.

02:23.351 --> 02:27.063
Not to the past that's set,
but to the future we can change.

02:31.651 --> 02:33.444
Even if we don't know how it will end.

02:41.035 --> 02:41.870
All right.

02:44.372 --> 02:45.206
Let's do that.

02:49.919 --> 02:51.796
CHOI DA-JIN
ENTER PASSWORD

02:52.547 --> 02:53.798
INCORRECT PASSWORD

02:55.091 --> 02:58.011
So you don't remember the password at all?

03:00.597 --> 03:01.556
Stop joking around.

03:01.639 --> 03:04.809
I'm not joking. It's killing me too.
I honestly have no clue.

03:04.893 --> 03:07.520
Can't you use
two-step verification to reset it?

03:08.104 --> 03:11.566
I guess I didn't register my number.
I'm not getting the codes.

03:12.150 --> 03:13.109
Da-jin.

03:14.277 --> 03:16.654
Come on, stop messing with me, seriously!

03:16.738 --> 03:20.450
This is driving me insane too!
It's like I've lost my memory!

03:21.910 --> 03:24.162
Like you've lost your memory?

03:25.580 --> 03:26.706
Memory?

03:27.498 --> 03:31.169
So she doesn't remember a thing
about the wishes. Every single detail.

03:33.838 --> 03:35.048
That's why…

03:36.883 --> 03:38.593
she's forgotten the password?

03:40.595 --> 03:42.639
What do we do about our videos?

03:44.015 --> 03:45.308
Yeong-hyeon, I'm sorry.

03:45.934 --> 03:47.894
Why did I do that?

03:47.977 --> 03:50.104
Why on earth did I change the password?

03:51.522 --> 03:54.317
Our wedding anniversary, your birthday,

03:55.193 --> 03:59.280
the day I first met you,
the day you proposed… It's none of those.

04:01.658 --> 04:03.868
So, your passwords

04:03.952 --> 04:05.662
were all things like that?

04:05.745 --> 04:09.207
I must be out of my mind.
How could I forget this?

04:18.132 --> 04:19.217
INCORRECT PASSWORD

04:29.978 --> 04:31.229
Da-jin.

04:31.980 --> 04:33.147
I'll make sure

04:33.731 --> 04:34.857
your dad

04:35.900 --> 04:37.026
gets better.

04:38.152 --> 04:40.780
What? What are you talking about?

04:42.156 --> 04:43.992
Where are you going?

04:48.579 --> 04:49.622
Ka-young.

04:51.416 --> 04:53.626
What's with you? What is all this?

04:53.710 --> 04:56.546
Who is that bastard?
That jerk named you when he surrendered--

04:56.629 --> 04:58.298
It's all right. It's all okay.

04:59.007 --> 05:00.258
It will all be all right.

05:01.175 --> 05:03.386
For now, let's go. You too, Min-ji.

05:03.469 --> 05:06.848
You both need to remain in hiding
from now on. I know a secure place.

05:06.931 --> 05:09.726
Sure. Lunatics like him
don't deserve the time of day.

05:09.809 --> 05:11.602
Running away is the right thing to do.

05:11.686 --> 05:15.315
Let's finish talking when we get there.
Where is it? Is it far?

05:21.988 --> 05:23.698
About Heung-rye's funeral…

05:24.449 --> 05:27.660
I'll make a generous gift.
For now, take this and get some sleep.

05:28.953 --> 05:32.332
I have something I need to do.
It must be done for everything to be okay.

05:33.291 --> 05:34.792
So even if it gets stifling,

05:35.585 --> 05:38.421
make sure you stay here, Grandma. Okay?

05:39.213 --> 05:40.256
All right.

05:41.382 --> 05:42.800
Be careful, okay?

05:42.884 --> 05:44.844
You'll go with her, won't you?

05:45.470 --> 05:48.806
Yes. Don't worry, Oh Pan-geum.
I'll stay by her side.

05:56.773 --> 05:58.483
The thing I said I'd tell you later--

05:58.566 --> 06:00.860
Forget it. You don't need to tell me.

06:01.444 --> 06:03.237
I already know it's Grandma.

06:04.113 --> 06:06.616
I'll consider this a housewarming
and get comfy.

06:07.575 --> 06:09.327
I see you've made yourself at home.

06:09.827 --> 06:11.496
Your dinner delivery has arrived.

06:14.374 --> 06:16.667
If you need anything, tell him.

06:17.377 --> 06:19.587
Sade, protect them with your life.

06:19.670 --> 06:21.297
Yes, Master. Leave it to me.

06:22.298 --> 06:23.841
Want jjajang or jjamppong?

06:23.925 --> 06:29.347
A genie, a beast, and a lamp
that's like a luxury Banpo Xi apartment.

06:29.430 --> 06:33.226
Despite all of this magic,
I must make it clear where I stand.

06:33.309 --> 06:35.269
My vote is still on evolution.

06:39.982 --> 06:42.693
Right, about that.

06:43.444 --> 06:45.279
That deserves its own conversation.

06:45.363 --> 06:47.490
Why don't you take something
and sleep it off?

06:47.573 --> 06:48.408
I could just…

06:51.077 --> 06:53.663
-Kim Ha-neul, did you find your toy?
-Yes.

06:53.746 --> 06:56.207
See? Daddy told you it would turn up.

06:56.290 --> 06:58.543
But you had to cry and make a fuss.

06:58.626 --> 07:01.421
Where was it? We couldn't find it
when we were looking for it.

07:01.504 --> 07:04.924
Ppoppi told me where it was.

07:05.007 --> 07:07.927
How could Ppoppi tell you?
Mommy told you he went to America.

07:08.010 --> 07:09.345
It's true.

07:09.429 --> 07:12.014
Ppoppi told me when he came last time.

07:12.098 --> 07:13.141
He whispered it to me.

07:16.727 --> 07:17.854
What's wrong?

07:25.236 --> 07:27.280
I, a former member
of the Reconnaissance Unit,

07:27.780 --> 07:29.532
inherited an enormous sum of money

07:29.615 --> 07:31.951
from an anonymous person.

07:32.452 --> 07:35.246
But I don't remember anything.

07:35.746 --> 07:39.333
In situations like these, there are
three options. The first option is to…

07:39.417 --> 07:40.251
Report it.

07:42.295 --> 07:43.588
The second is…

07:44.088 --> 07:45.715
NEAT STACK SAFE

07:45.798 --> 07:47.425
Stash it.

07:50.678 --> 07:52.388
The third and final option is…

08:04.400 --> 08:05.985
So you've been abandoned too.

08:07.820 --> 08:09.322
Do you want to come with me?

08:10.156 --> 08:12.700
My house is full of your friends.

08:14.202 --> 08:17.747
Before any of that,
what should we call you?

08:20.750 --> 08:21.667
Ppoppi.

08:23.753 --> 08:25.296
Yes, Ppoppi sounds good.

08:28.090 --> 08:29.133
Chauffeur Choi?

08:31.844 --> 08:33.804
Let's get going, shall we?

08:36.557 --> 08:38.476
I chose the third option.

08:39.101 --> 08:41.103
It's strange, and I miss it.

08:41.604 --> 08:44.106
I feel like I will forever be waiting.

08:46.442 --> 08:48.444
Even the anonymous have names.

08:49.195 --> 08:51.197
I, now an abandoned dog detective,

08:51.697 --> 08:55.034
am on my way to find those of you
who have abandoned your pet dogs.

09:03.167 --> 09:05.378
Have you still not made up your mind?

09:06.212 --> 09:07.588
That won't do, will it?

09:13.302 --> 09:16.055
I'm not sure what you're playing at
by holding out like this,

09:16.138 --> 09:20.059
but all you need to do
is put the world to sleep immediately.

09:22.228 --> 09:27.149
Obey Father's orders
so that he can bind Iblis.

09:33.823 --> 09:34.991
The door is open.

10:02.685 --> 10:04.854
You total psycho.
What the hell are you doing?

10:06.480 --> 10:09.650
I'll give you all of this money.
Sell me your final wish.

10:10.860 --> 10:13.029
If you don't sell it, I'll burn it all.

10:13.112 --> 10:16.407
I'm sure you're aware
that I will actually set it on fire.

10:17.908 --> 10:22.038
Whatever wish you make,
I will simply wish to undo it.

10:23.039 --> 10:24.457
So just sell it to me.

10:25.124 --> 10:26.459
I'm asking you to please…

10:28.794 --> 10:30.796
choose the money, Gu Bo-gyeong.

10:37.011 --> 10:38.220
Why would I trust you?

10:38.304 --> 10:41.682
We don't need to trust each other.
We need rules.

10:42.266 --> 10:43.726
I follow rules, no matter what.

10:44.310 --> 10:47.229
You hand over your wish,
and I hand you this money.

10:47.313 --> 10:48.481
That would be it.

10:49.065 --> 10:50.232
This would be our rule.

11:04.372 --> 11:06.040
What do I need to wish for?

11:36.696 --> 11:38.114
I'll make my final wish.

11:40.908 --> 11:44.620
Go and tell Ki Ka-young
that I made the wish exactly as she asked.

12:05.224 --> 12:08.602
In your past life, you sold hundreds
of lives to buy your way into heaven.

12:09.103 --> 12:12.481
Now, in this life, you're still
causing trouble for others, Ms. Ki.

12:13.107 --> 12:14.734
A bit rich coming from you.

12:14.817 --> 12:16.861
You scared an eight-year-old

12:16.944 --> 12:19.655
into using her final wish
to confine Iblis.

12:20.948 --> 12:23.784
And you're still doing that
in this life. Get lost.

12:23.868 --> 12:25.703
I simply stated the facts.

12:25.786 --> 12:27.621
Not all facts tell the truth.

12:27.705 --> 12:29.165
It's a pity,

12:29.248 --> 12:32.376
but no matter what you do,
I will slit Iblis's throat.

12:33.502 --> 12:36.172
I followed his orders
and bowed before humans.

12:36.255 --> 12:39.216
Iblis, however,
rebelled against his every word.

12:39.300 --> 12:40.426
Not once

12:41.051 --> 12:42.887
has he obeyed his orders willingly.

12:43.888 --> 12:47.224
The only reason
he continues to forgive Shaytan

12:47.308 --> 12:49.226
is so I may slit his throat.

12:49.310 --> 12:51.395
That means that my slitting Iblis's throat

12:52.897 --> 12:55.691
is something he will truly rejoice in.

13:00.613 --> 13:03.783
What's with the engineering student logic?
My arm hurts.

13:05.159 --> 13:07.328
See here, Mr. Angel.

13:08.287 --> 13:09.997
That thing you're doing right now?

13:10.080 --> 13:12.625
It's called envy. An inferiority complex.

13:12.708 --> 13:14.502
It is greater than that.

13:15.252 --> 13:17.797
-My will aligns with his--
-Don't hide behind him!

13:18.672 --> 13:22.009
You will never slit Iblis's throat.
Do you know why?

13:24.094 --> 13:26.722
Because I will make
an incredibly selfish final wish.

13:29.016 --> 13:30.142
I was…

13:32.603 --> 13:33.771
always…

13:35.815 --> 13:37.608
born evil.

14:21.360 --> 14:24.071
JOY

14:26.574 --> 14:29.034
DESPAIR

14:31.537 --> 14:33.330
LONGING

14:33.414 --> 14:34.832
WAITING

14:39.128 --> 14:40.546
MIN-JI'S EMOTIONS ARE SO EASY

14:40.629 --> 14:42.631
RULE: NEVER SNEER AT PEOPLE LIKE THIS

14:43.674 --> 14:46.510
I knew you'd take a peek
eventually, you Satan.

14:46.594 --> 14:49.138
Turn it off when you're done.
Electricity is not free.

14:58.647 --> 15:00.065
Did you meet Gu Bo-gyeong?

15:00.149 --> 15:01.775
She still seems to remember.

15:01.859 --> 15:05.404
Did she do it?
Did she make her final wish?

15:06.655 --> 15:08.324
She did. As did Ko Yeong-hyeon.

15:09.241 --> 15:10.159
Human kindness

15:11.452 --> 15:12.578
is very surprising.

15:13.370 --> 15:14.246
They weren't corrupt.

15:16.040 --> 15:17.207
Really?

15:18.334 --> 15:19.418
Hey, wake up.

15:19.501 --> 15:21.921
Ko Yeong-hyeon, wake up, will you?

15:22.796 --> 15:24.465
How did you know? Tell me how.

15:24.548 --> 15:28.010
Hey, what's wrong? Why are you crying?

15:28.093 --> 15:29.178
What did I know?

15:29.261 --> 15:31.764
Before you left,
you said you'd make Dad better.

15:32.264 --> 15:35.017
I just heard that my dad's
cancer cells have disappeared.

15:35.517 --> 15:37.811
No one knows why.
The doctors say it's a miracle!

15:37.895 --> 15:38.979
-Wait, really?
-Yes!

15:39.063 --> 15:40.564
Hey, that's amazing news!

15:41.607 --> 15:42.483
Hold up.

15:42.983 --> 15:46.612
Did I really say
something like that? When?

15:48.530 --> 15:49.573
Thank you, Yeong-hyeon.

15:49.657 --> 15:52.326
It's as if your words made him better.

15:52.826 --> 15:53.994
Like some kind of magic.

15:54.078 --> 15:56.330
It's okay. Hey, your phone.

15:56.413 --> 15:57.331
Right.

15:59.375 --> 16:00.542
Hi, Dad.

16:01.377 --> 16:02.795
I was just telling him.

16:03.504 --> 16:04.421
What?

16:05.172 --> 16:07.716
Slow down. What's blowing up your phone?

16:09.051 --> 16:12.888
Two-step verification codes
for a YouTube account? They went to you?

16:12.972 --> 16:13.973
What codes…

16:14.056 --> 16:16.600
Dad, you'll get another code now.
Read it out to me.

16:17.267 --> 16:20.312
Yeong-hyeon, we can restore
all of our videos.

16:20.396 --> 16:22.648
We have almost over 600,000 views now!

16:23.357 --> 16:25.484
-Yes.
-Six hundred… thousand?

16:25.567 --> 16:29.571
Did you just say
our video has over 600,000 views?

16:31.490 --> 16:33.075
-Hey!
-What?

16:33.158 --> 16:35.452
-Did you flash your chest?
-What?

16:36.286 --> 16:38.288
You scumbag. Come here, you.

16:38.372 --> 16:40.332
-Hey, I'm sorry!
-That's your first thought?

16:41.333 --> 16:43.544
So does that mean I won't be dying

16:44.336 --> 16:45.838
because of our bet?

16:45.921 --> 16:49.758
I say we should count
Gu Bo-gyeong's final wish as 0.5,

16:50.467 --> 16:52.928
and I'll try to argue the point
that it's 2.5 to 2.5.

16:54.805 --> 16:58.308
I'm heading off now.
Make sure you come to save me, Master.

17:01.979 --> 17:02.813
Right now?

17:03.981 --> 17:04.815
Already?

17:04.898 --> 17:07.234
Since the dawn of time,
the first to strike has won.

17:08.110 --> 17:09.153
Don't worry.

17:09.695 --> 17:11.447
I've never lost to anyone except you…

17:50.569 --> 17:53.030
Knowing that one of them
must be destroyed,

17:53.697 --> 17:57.743
I see Iblis has come to entertain
the impossible hope that both might live.

17:58.535 --> 18:00.996
As it stands now,
both Iblis and Ms. Ki Ka-young

18:01.497 --> 18:03.332
will try to save each other.

18:05.334 --> 18:07.628
That certainly seems the case
for Ki Ka-young.

18:10.631 --> 18:13.133
Then I won't be able to finish this war.

18:14.718 --> 18:16.470
Did you say war?

18:47.584 --> 18:49.711
Please, child. Stop.

18:49.795 --> 18:53.215
I will put the world to sleep
and bind Iblis.

18:55.300 --> 18:56.510
The day has finally come.

18:57.136 --> 18:59.471
It's today?
Is today finally the day, Father?

18:59.555 --> 19:02.015
That's why I will do the binding.

19:03.600 --> 19:05.310
I no longer heal when cut by this thread.

19:11.817 --> 19:13.277
I can simply not fall asleep.

19:15.279 --> 19:16.280
Khalid!

19:25.998 --> 19:27.875
All right. Now sing!

19:34.464 --> 19:35.841
Iblis has come willingly.

19:38.218 --> 19:39.428
Father, sing.

19:39.511 --> 19:40.554
I said sing!

19:57.362 --> 19:59.907
When that day comes,
there is something you must do.

19:59.990 --> 20:02.492
That's all you need to do.
Am I understood?

20:29.770 --> 20:31.939
We meet at last.

20:32.022 --> 20:35.067
I have waited 1,000 years for you.

20:35.150 --> 20:37.861
So you really had to go this far.

20:38.487 --> 20:41.406
I received something invaluable today.

20:41.490 --> 20:42.658
Thank you, Father.

20:49.706 --> 20:52.334
Now, my son, will you grant me freedom?

20:52.417 --> 20:53.794
Yes, that's right.

20:53.877 --> 20:55.003
But

20:56.088 --> 20:58.131
I'd rather take that freedom for myself.

20:59.424 --> 21:00.425
Shadi!

21:07.224 --> 21:10.143
Don't forget my last request, Iblis.

21:15.565 --> 21:17.109
This was, I'm afraid,

21:17.651 --> 21:19.695
the best I could do, my brother.

21:26.410 --> 21:29.037
You do not possess the soul of a human

21:30.831 --> 21:33.000
nor the generosity of a spirit.

21:34.668 --> 21:35.711
You will…

21:37.838 --> 21:39.089
die by my hands.

21:40.132 --> 21:40.966
Are you angry?

21:41.925 --> 21:44.511
Aren't you being too harsh
on an orphan who can't hear?

21:48.765 --> 21:51.018
What about that bitch? Do you have her?

22:13.707 --> 22:16.001
It's time for you to make your final wish.

22:16.585 --> 22:17.919
Where is the lamp?

22:18.003 --> 22:20.547
Refusing will only harm
the ones you care about.

22:20.630 --> 22:24.134
Your grandma, your friend,
your village neighbors.

22:24.634 --> 22:27.637
Will you wish to transfer ownership
of the lamp to me, friend?

22:28.138 --> 22:29.681
So this is a zero-sum game.

22:31.266 --> 22:32.559
Fine.

22:33.602 --> 22:35.228
Enough with the faux friendship.

22:36.521 --> 22:39.358
Just knock yourself the fuck out.

22:39.941 --> 22:40.984
In quotes.

22:41.068 --> 22:42.611
What are you saying?

22:42.694 --> 22:44.654
Where the hell is the lamp?

22:48.658 --> 22:51.078
What the hell? Where did she go?

22:51.161 --> 22:53.997
That crazy bitch
just wasted her final wish like this?

22:54.581 --> 22:56.291
Find her at once!

22:56.375 --> 22:57.334
Yes.

23:01.922 --> 23:03.548
What do I need to wish for?

23:03.632 --> 23:05.217
Whatever the day or the moment,

23:05.300 --> 23:09.179
when Ki Ka-young says,
"Just knock yourself the fuck out,"

23:10.138 --> 23:12.599
take Ki Ka-young to Iblis's side.

23:13.100 --> 23:14.726
That's what you'll wish for.

23:14.810 --> 23:16.269
Did you get that?

23:16.353 --> 23:17.771
What do you take me for?

23:45.549 --> 23:47.509
Damn it. They really tied you up good.

23:54.599 --> 23:56.435
This is the extent of my plans.

23:57.394 --> 23:58.395
What do we do now?

23:58.478 --> 24:01.273
This is where my plans start.
For starters, we have thread.

24:01.857 --> 24:04.901
With that thread in hand,
I'll head to my brother's garden.

24:05.527 --> 24:07.737
You two, follow me.
Everyone else, spread out!

24:08.321 --> 24:09.322
Hurry and find her!

24:11.199 --> 24:14.035
He's half-human, half-spirit.
That thread is fatal to him too.

24:14.119 --> 24:15.745
Though I'm not sure I can carry it.

24:16.872 --> 24:18.165
Carry it.

24:23.420 --> 24:27.215
Don't worry about me. Just go.
Go get rid of the immortal one.

24:44.774 --> 24:49.488
Oh my, I feel sick. I think we're being
taken somewhere else right now.

24:54.201 --> 24:58.288
What could be happening?
I'll go and check things out.

25:08.381 --> 25:10.217
Who are you? Another mythical beast?

25:13.929 --> 25:15.013
Irem.

25:20.352 --> 25:21.770
This is a gift from Ejllael.

25:22.437 --> 25:23.271
A gift?

25:29.736 --> 25:30.695
This must be it.

25:32.239 --> 25:33.949
This is Iblis's lamp.

25:35.408 --> 25:37.869
Irem, what did you just do?

25:37.953 --> 25:40.997
I told you to do what's right by you.

25:41.498 --> 25:43.250
I'm just following my master's orders.

25:43.333 --> 25:45.418
This is what Ejllael ordered? Why exactly?

25:45.502 --> 25:47.837
We do not question our masters' orders.

25:48.505 --> 25:49.798
We simply obey.

25:53.677 --> 25:54.719
Irem!

25:58.348 --> 26:00.267
How come I can still see this?

26:01.893 --> 26:04.729
It's meant to disappear
once you've made your three wishes.

26:06.648 --> 26:08.775
She deceived me.

26:09.276 --> 26:11.152
There's one wish left!

26:13.363 --> 26:14.239
That bitch.

26:15.407 --> 26:16.908
Go find her.

26:16.992 --> 26:19.452
Find her, whatever it takes. Hurry!

26:19.536 --> 26:20.370
Yes!

26:20.453 --> 26:21.329
Stop right there!

26:23.832 --> 26:25.041
I'll kill you all.

26:34.342 --> 26:36.928
The day you find dead birds
on the roads for no reason,

26:37.512 --> 26:38.680
that is the day.

26:38.763 --> 26:40.307
Please come to save us.

27:58.259 --> 27:59.844
You're not here to see me, are you?

28:06.559 --> 28:08.019
I'm in the middle of something.

28:11.439 --> 28:13.566
Ki Ka-young will soon be
making her final wish.

28:13.650 --> 28:16.111
I thought I'd try
to buy some time until then.

28:16.194 --> 28:18.446
If you strike that flower before then,

28:19.948 --> 28:21.658
it would destroy my plans.

28:22.951 --> 28:24.160
About your painting.

28:26.579 --> 28:28.498
You asked why I took the angels' eyes.

28:30.542 --> 28:31.668
They were full of desire.

28:32.836 --> 28:35.672
And I see this is the desire I sensed.

28:37.173 --> 28:39.134
For you, the 300-year war

28:40.051 --> 28:40.885
isn't over.

28:40.969 --> 28:43.179
Did you really believe that war was over?

28:43.763 --> 28:45.932
Did that war bring an end to anything?

28:46.766 --> 28:49.060
That is why
you shouldn't have removed that sword.

28:49.769 --> 28:52.272
The very sword that annihilated us angels.

28:52.856 --> 28:55.984
You should never
have met her again either.

28:57.402 --> 29:00.905
Now you've recovered your memories,
you must know how things ended.

29:03.366 --> 29:05.660
I hope Ki Ka-young's wish
will be righteous.

29:05.744 --> 29:07.495
Then I will slit your throat

29:08.246 --> 29:10.749
and put her back
to the way she always was.

29:11.249 --> 29:14.377
She will forget you
and return to the hell she once lived in,

29:14.461 --> 29:15.837
condemned as a psychopath.

29:17.172 --> 29:19.549
Because that is the appropriate fate
for a human

29:19.632 --> 29:21.009
who was loved by Satan.

29:21.718 --> 29:24.345
In her previous life and now.

29:26.055 --> 29:27.599
I also hope, more than anyone…

29:29.642 --> 29:31.811
that her last wish will be righteous.

29:32.562 --> 29:34.105
She may have been born evil,

29:34.856 --> 29:37.650
but she lived a dull life
to avoid bad choices.

29:39.569 --> 29:41.946
I hope the rest of her life is heaven.

29:42.947 --> 29:44.574
Of course she would forget me

29:46.034 --> 29:49.120
and go back to her normal life,
being condemned as a psychopath.

29:49.621 --> 29:51.247
And her life may be dull,

29:52.749 --> 29:54.501
but she would be a righteous human,

29:54.584 --> 29:57.420
worthy of love, just as he intended.

29:59.631 --> 30:01.841
I'm sure that's why we were reunited.

30:04.427 --> 30:05.887
So that the end of this war…

30:07.889 --> 30:09.557
may be Ki Ka-young's heaven.

30:18.191 --> 30:19.859
So you, too, must bow.

30:20.819 --> 30:21.778
Bow before her.

30:39.003 --> 30:41.089
CONVENIENCE STORE CLERK
FORMER MARINE, CLASS 1185

30:47.554 --> 30:49.305
STRAWBERRY FARMER
WELTERWEIGHT CHAMPION

30:49.389 --> 30:51.224
CAFE OWNER, NEW CIVVIE
ALL FORMER MARINES

30:51.307 --> 30:52.267
CHEONGPUNG MARINES

30:52.350 --> 30:53.309
PARK CHANG-SIK

30:53.393 --> 30:55.144
Operation Cave Cleaning.

31:02.819 --> 31:03.695
From grit to grit.

31:03.778 --> 31:06.823
If it won't do, make it do.
If it won't work, make it work.

31:09.075 --> 31:11.995
All right, let's go!

32:40.208 --> 32:42.961
Who are you? How did you get in here?

32:43.628 --> 32:45.380
Are you another one of those things?

32:45.463 --> 32:47.215
I'm sorry, I can't hear.

32:48.299 --> 32:50.301
Your granddaughter's
waiting for you outside.

32:50.385 --> 32:52.095
My Ka-young is here?

32:52.971 --> 32:55.181
But who are you?

32:56.015 --> 32:57.141
Where did you get it?

32:57.642 --> 32:58.851
That thread.

33:22.417 --> 33:25.086
Grandma, no matter what,
don't let go of my hand.

33:25.670 --> 33:28.423
What the hell are you blabbering about?
Look at me.

33:28.506 --> 33:29.507
I said look at me!

33:32.760 --> 33:34.637
Your granddaughter made my father mad,

33:34.721 --> 33:36.723
so I think it's time to drop some corpses.

33:37.306 --> 33:40.184
Which order would be the most threatening?

33:40.268 --> 33:44.147
I guess the friend first
and then blood relations, right?

33:44.814 --> 33:46.065
Kill her first.

33:47.567 --> 33:48.901
Who are you people?

33:50.111 --> 33:51.320
What is all this?

33:59.787 --> 34:00.621
Father!

34:00.705 --> 34:02.040
Father!

34:06.794 --> 34:08.171
It must be today.

34:09.756 --> 34:11.507
Not next spring.

34:11.591 --> 34:13.551
Grandma, try breaking the thread.

34:14.927 --> 34:15.928
What the…

34:17.764 --> 34:20.725
When the plum blossoms
next bloom in your garden…

34:20.808 --> 34:21.684
Good heavens.

34:21.768 --> 34:22.935
…you will die.

34:23.436 --> 34:24.270
What is it?

34:26.355 --> 34:27.190
Min-ji.

34:27.273 --> 34:31.444
Make sure you tell my dear Ka-young
everything I tell you now.

34:33.446 --> 34:34.697
Ka-young.

34:35.531 --> 34:38.534
Raising you was such a blessing.

34:39.285 --> 34:42.038
You got good grades, you're beautiful,

34:42.538 --> 34:44.749
and not once did you do anything wrong.

34:45.249 --> 34:46.417
So, whatever you do,

34:46.918 --> 34:50.171
you must not make
a bad choice because of me.

34:50.254 --> 34:51.839
Tell her that, will you?

34:53.549 --> 34:55.343
Sure, but for now, let's run.

34:57.345 --> 34:58.179
Father!

34:58.930 --> 34:59.764
Father!

35:17.573 --> 35:18.574
Mr. Seo I-deuk!

35:20.576 --> 35:21.577
Kill her!

35:22.203 --> 35:23.663
Min-ji!

35:34.715 --> 35:36.676
A strange thing for a boy to have.

35:46.435 --> 35:48.312
I made the plum blossoms bloom

35:49.063 --> 35:51.315
in the garden with my own hands.

35:57.363 --> 35:59.907
Grandma, no!

35:59.991 --> 36:03.244
Mi-ju, please! No!

36:04.287 --> 36:07.498
Mi-ju, no! This can't be!

36:08.708 --> 36:10.293
This is the wrong order!

36:10.376 --> 36:12.003
I said this bitch goes first!

36:16.048 --> 36:17.967
-No!
-You psycho bitch!

36:18.050 --> 36:20.261
Spit it out. Spit it out right now!

36:21.596 --> 36:22.763
Open her up.

36:22.847 --> 36:25.725
-Take the thread out!
-Please don't do that. Please!

36:25.808 --> 36:27.560
Please!

36:27.643 --> 36:28.978
No!

36:48.289 --> 36:49.207
Sade.

37:28.663 --> 37:29.830
Grandma.

37:31.082 --> 37:31.916
Grandma?

37:31.999 --> 37:33.459
Grandma, she…

37:33.542 --> 37:34.752
Because of me, she…

37:41.759 --> 37:43.219
You can't die, Grandma!

37:43.928 --> 37:45.263
You can't just leave me!

37:47.098 --> 37:49.141
As long as she's still breathing.
The lamp.

37:49.225 --> 37:50.518
Where is the lamp?

37:51.102 --> 37:53.521
You need to use your last wish on me.

37:53.604 --> 37:56.065
This bitch has already stopped breathing.

37:56.148 --> 37:57.566
Don't hold out too long,

37:58.234 --> 37:59.777
or that bitch dies too.

38:01.237 --> 38:04.532
But before that, we'll slice
this bitch open and take my thread out.

38:05.032 --> 38:06.867
She swallowed my thread, you see.

38:12.206 --> 38:13.791
No!

38:13.874 --> 38:16.627
No! Don't!

38:21.257 --> 38:22.508
Come on in!

38:31.183 --> 38:32.351
Let's go!

38:44.905 --> 38:46.365
Drag her down to the basement!

38:46.949 --> 38:47.992
Let go of me!

39:02.590 --> 39:04.842
Dr. Choi, get it together.
Help me take her.

39:22.443 --> 39:25.654
You had the chance to kill me, so why?

39:31.660 --> 39:33.579
Why didn't you kill me?

39:35.081 --> 39:36.707
You still have a job to do.

39:38.626 --> 39:40.294
You need to come and slit my throat.

39:43.714 --> 39:44.548
Move aside.

39:55.184 --> 39:56.102
Please, Brother.

39:57.645 --> 39:59.188
End my son's life.

40:00.648 --> 40:05.027
That is the reason I walked all night
to find and bind you.

40:07.196 --> 40:09.031
I beg of you, my brother.

40:17.331 --> 40:20.084
You fucking bastard, I'll kill you!

40:20.167 --> 40:22.002
Call on Iblis!

40:22.086 --> 40:24.338
Use your final wish
to transfer the lamp to me!

40:24.422 --> 40:25.756
Make the wish for me!

40:25.840 --> 40:29.593
I would rather make this decision
than transfer my wish.

40:33.139 --> 40:36.016
You psycho bitch, do you want to die?

40:36.100 --> 40:38.185
Kill me. Go on!

40:38.269 --> 40:41.063
Yeah? Then I'll kill you myself.

40:49.280 --> 40:50.239
I saw it.

40:50.322 --> 40:53.492
A thousand years ago, when you were dying,

40:53.576 --> 40:58.581
Iblis revealed the lamp himself
to save you.

40:59.123 --> 41:03.878
Please use one of your wishes
to save this girl.

41:03.961 --> 41:06.505
Please, I beg you!

41:16.182 --> 41:20.311
It would be nice
for such a moment to come once more.

41:20.811 --> 41:21.854
Come, Iblis!

41:50.341 --> 41:51.550
Father!

41:51.634 --> 41:52.927
Father.

41:53.427 --> 41:55.179
No!

41:55.262 --> 41:56.347
Father!

42:23.541 --> 42:25.125
So the thing you longed for

42:26.001 --> 42:27.670
was this war.

42:30.839 --> 42:31.674
No.

42:33.259 --> 42:34.718
The thing I longed for…

42:38.097 --> 42:39.348
was victory.

42:48.399 --> 42:49.316
Father?

42:49.817 --> 42:50.776
Father!

42:52.987 --> 42:54.113
I'll kill you!

43:11.880 --> 43:14.049
Are you okay? Are you hurt at all?

43:15.009 --> 43:15.926
Grandma was…

43:16.427 --> 43:17.595
Grandma and Sade are…

44:04.224 --> 44:06.602
The individual had no breath
or pulse upon rescue.

44:07.478 --> 44:09.188
Clean with no visible trauma.

44:09.813 --> 44:11.440
Let's contact the Jeil Hospital ER--

44:11.523 --> 44:12.358
No.

44:13.025 --> 44:15.277
Let's go straight to the funeral home.

44:18.155 --> 44:19.239
She's dead.

44:19.823 --> 44:20.741
I know that.

44:20.824 --> 44:24.787
But legally, a doctor must pronounce
the death before any funeral arrangements.

44:24.870 --> 44:27.873
-We need to confirm her identity.
-I know her.

44:27.956 --> 44:29.708
And according to the law…

44:31.794 --> 44:33.754
dentists can also pronounce someone dead.

44:35.547 --> 44:36.715
Ms. Oh Pan-geum.

44:38.509 --> 44:39.718
Time of death.

44:40.761 --> 44:41.970
October 5th…

44:47.059 --> 44:48.560
at 18:23.

44:51.146 --> 44:52.523
She has passed.

45:10.749 --> 45:13.836
I will now also give you sorrow

45:17.506 --> 45:20.634
I will give you sorrow
More precious than love

45:24.430 --> 45:28.809
Other genie, what does Oh Pan-geum
ask the most besides the weather?

45:29.393 --> 45:32.354
Ms. Oh Pan-geum searched the following.

45:32.438 --> 45:36.442
Ways to heal my dear Ka-young's illness.

45:36.525 --> 45:40.362
How to fix a psychopath.
Foods that are good for psychopaths.

45:42.906 --> 45:45.909
An old woman who had laid
A few tangerines on the street

45:46.910 --> 45:48.537
KA-YOUNG, YOU'RE BEAUTIFUL TODAY AS ALWAYS

45:48.620 --> 45:51.457
Shivering from a lifetime of cold
On a winter's night

45:51.540 --> 45:53.500
FROM SORROW TO JOY
POETRY BY JEONG HO-SEUNG

45:53.584 --> 45:56.837
To you, who rejoiced as you haggled
The price of tangerines

46:03.177 --> 46:06.930
I shall show you sorrow's equal face

46:16.023 --> 46:18.776
When I called out to you from the darkness

46:24.615 --> 46:25.574
Please leave.

46:26.950 --> 46:28.994
We will wash and dress the deceased.

46:29.578 --> 46:30.496
Please leave.

46:31.121 --> 46:34.041
Not once did you show me an equal smile

46:36.960 --> 46:39.922
When a frozen corpse
Froze yet again under a straw sack

46:40.005 --> 46:42.257
GRANDCHILD: KI KA-YOUNG

46:43.842 --> 46:46.470
You did not so much
As cover it with another sack

46:52.601 --> 46:55.187
For your indifferent love

46:56.939 --> 46:59.983
For your tears
That seem incapable of flowing

47:04.404 --> 47:05.322
It's uncomfortable.

47:05.405 --> 47:08.826
I will now also give you waiting

47:11.203 --> 47:14.248
Just put up with it for today.

47:15.999 --> 47:17.292
You must.

47:17.960 --> 47:20.170
Every decision I made
was for our happiness.

47:22.548 --> 47:24.299
But because Grandma just died,

47:24.800 --> 47:26.802
this is all so uncomfortable right now!

47:26.885 --> 47:28.220
You're uncomfortable?

47:29.763 --> 47:32.391
You feel uncomfortable
about making the wrong call?

47:33.267 --> 47:34.101
What about me?

47:35.310 --> 47:38.814
I lost Grandma, and…

47:42.234 --> 47:44.111
Though it was only a short while, I…

47:55.747 --> 47:57.124
So you tough it out too.

48:01.086 --> 48:02.588
So if I decide something…

48:04.715 --> 48:06.842
it makes everyone unhappy like this.

48:08.093 --> 48:09.261
Be my friend.

48:09.344 --> 48:11.930
What happens if I say I don't want to?

48:12.514 --> 48:14.725
You and me, we're both negative ones.

48:14.808 --> 48:16.018
You don't have a choice.

48:16.643 --> 48:18.604
Multiply us, and we'll be at least one.

48:19.104 --> 48:20.480
That's why we're friends.

48:22.232 --> 48:24.359
I really am a negative one.

48:30.741 --> 48:33.118
Your mom sent this
to cover the cost of the funeral.

48:36.580 --> 48:40.167
I will put an end to the heavy snow
That once fell on this world

48:42.210 --> 48:45.339
You said you were going
to a better place than Hawaii.

48:45.839 --> 48:48.425
How could you come back to us like this?

48:48.508 --> 48:52.304
Goodness me.

48:56.308 --> 48:58.101
Goodness, what to do?

49:09.655 --> 49:12.449
I will take the spring snow
That fell on the barley fields

49:13.951 --> 49:17.037
And visit the sorrows of the people
Shivering with cold

49:21.375 --> 49:23.126
I will walk the snowy paths with you

49:24.920 --> 49:26.505
Where it no longer snows

49:36.139 --> 49:38.058
Would you look at that?

49:38.976 --> 49:41.144
She's like that
even at her grandma's funeral?

49:41.645 --> 49:44.731
She sure is strange.
She hasn't shed a single tear.

49:51.863 --> 49:54.700
Must you act strange on a day like this?

49:55.367 --> 49:57.869
This is why I said
Gyeong-seok should hold her picture!

50:01.039 --> 50:03.458
Mom.

50:04.167 --> 50:07.379
Mom!

50:17.723 --> 50:20.183
We will talk of the power of sorrow

50:23.061 --> 50:24.688
And walk all the way

50:26.064 --> 50:27.357
To the sorrow of waiting

53:56.900 --> 54:01.905
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
